  m_text: "DEAR YOUNG TRAVELER\n\nThis is Ankig, the Prince Goose of Gooseville.
    I have heard many great words about you. You have been called upon to awaken
    the Pumgeese from their slumber. Please take the next sailboat to the island
    of Tornviken.\n\nANKIG \n"
